ction converts  it into a list python lift and then we  can print out the first three results of  it  and as we can see  it worked properly sadly the labels of  the model are not defined so we cannot  see like positive and negative but  um that's something you can change in  the config from your model  if you want to learn more about hugging  face on amazon search maker we have a  nice detailed documentation at  huggingface.com  bye
 

